SHOW TRACE FOR TASK :qx_task_oid LIMIT 20;
 trace_state |        trace_name        |                         trace_detail                         | has_step | has_semantic_lsn 
-------------+--------------------------+--------------------------------------------------------------+----------+------------------
 closed      | runtime.queue            | goal=summarize docs;priority=high                            | f        | t
 closed      | runtime.dispatch         | attempt_opened;state=r                                       | t        | t
 closed      | runtime.capture_input    | input_present=true;task_name=summarize_docs                  | t        | t
 closed      | runtime.checkpoint       | checkpoint=stage8.after_capture;task_state=k                 | t        | t
 closed      | runtime.pause            | Task paused at durable checkpoint and awaits RESUME TASK     | f        | t
 closed      | runtime.resume           | checkpoint=stage8.after_capture;resume_requested;next_step=4 | f        | t
 closed      | runtime.resume_dispatch  | resume_from=stage8.after_capture;state=r                     | t        | t
 closed      | runtime.final_checkpoint | checkpoint=stage8.final;task_state=c                         | t        | t
 closed      | runtime.complete         | Task completed after resumable attempt handoff               | f        | t
(9 rows)

